00:00:00.920 --> 00:00:05.349 align:start position:0%
 
[Music]  do you spend time with your family  good  because a man who doesn't spend time  with his family can never be a real man  you can do anything but never go against  the family  [Music]  the strength of a family like the  strength of an army lies in its loyalty  to each other  [Music]  keep your friends close but your enemies  closer  i work my whole life i don't apologize  to take care of my family i don't  apologize that's my life  she's very beautiful to you she's  beautiful for me there's only my wife  and son  [Music]  a man who is not a father to his  children can never be a real man  [Music]  a friend should always underestimate  your virtues and an enemy overestimate  your faults  falling in love is great but being in  love is a disaster  [Music]  any man can turn traitor  [Music]  some honorable men spend their whole  lives preparing for a supreme act of  treachery  [Music]  we are all honorable men here we do not  have to give each other assurances as if  we were lawyers  [Music]  the lawyer with the briefcase can steal  more money than the man with the gun  [Music]  behind every successful fortune there is  a crime  many young men started down a false path  to their true destiny  time and fortune usually set them all  right  never let anyone know what you are  thinking  power wears out those who do not have it  [Music]  when they come  they come at what you love  i spent my whole life trying not to be  careless  women and children can afford to be  careless  men cannot  men in general sooner forget the loss of  their matrimony than the death of their  father  he should be careful it's dangerous to  be an honest man  like many businessmen of genius he  learned that free competition was  wasteful  monopoly efficient  you live like a fool and you have come  to a fool's end  none of us here wants to see our  children follow in our footsteps  it's too hard a life  your love is also your weak point  the richest man is the one with the most  powerful friends  even the strongest man needs friends  [Music]  men understand friendship more than  women do  [Music]  as i am a reasonable man i'm willing to  do whatever is necessary to find a  peaceful solution to these problems  don't raise your voice improve your  argument  [Music]  i have learned more in the streets than  in any classroom  good health is the most important thing  more than success more than money more  than power  [Music]  each man has his own destiny  time erodes gratitude more quickly than  it does beauty  i respect those who tell me the truth no  matter how hard it is  [Music]  in this world there comes a time when  the most humble of men  if he keeps his eyes open  can take his revenge on the most  powerful of men  friendship is everything friendship is  more than talent it is more than the  government  it is almost the equal of family  i raised my daughter in the american  fashion i gave her freedom but i taught  her never to dishonor her family  [Music]  italians have a little joke  that the world is so hard a man must  have two fathers to look after him  and that's why they have godfathers  my father is no different than any man  with power  like a president or a senator  [Music]  do not count on the gratitude of deeds  done for people in the past  you must make them grateful for things  you will do for them in the future  [Music]  your enemies always get strong on what  you leave behind  revenge is a dish best served cold  [Music]  never hate your enemies it affects your  judgment  [Music]  [Music]  [Music]  you

